# SentinelAI — AI-Powered Phishing & Cyber Threat Analyzer

## About the Project
SentinelAI is a cybersecurity mini-project designed to help users analyze suspicious URLs and identify potential phishing threats.

## Problem Statement
Phishing attacks use deceptive links to trick users into revealing sensitive information. SentinelAI aims to help users recognize suspicious URLs and improve online safety.

## Objectives
- Analyze URLs for potential phishing indicators.
- Help users understand potential cyber threats.
- Promote cybersecurity awareness.
- Provide a simple, user-friendly interface.

